+    # Tauri 2 desktop webview origins — same-machine local apps (Companion,
+    # any other Tauri client). Always allowed regardless of cors_origins
+    # config because:
+    #   - macOS / Linux Tauri 2 webview reports Origin: tauri://localhost
+    #   - Windows Tauri 2 webview reports Origin: http://tauri.localhost
+    #   - These origins can never be reached by a remote browser tab (the
+    #     custom scheme / .localhost is intercepted by the OS / Tauri runtime),
